## 🎨 Design System

| Token | Value | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `--ink` | `#0a0a0f` | Page background |
| `--surface` | `#111118` | Secondary surfaces |
| `--card` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.04)` | Glass card fill |
| `--accent` | `#c084fc` | Lilac — primary accent |
| `--accent2` | `#67e8f9` | Ice cyan — secondary accent |
| `--grad` | `135deg, #c084fc → #67e8f9` | Gradient on headings, buttons, bars |
| `--ff-d` | Syne | Display / headings |
| `--ff-b` | Space Grotesk | Body text |
| `--ff-m` | JetBrains Mono | Labels, tags, dates |

---

## 🔧 Customisation Guide

### Update Personal Info

Open `index.html` and search for the following placeholders:

| Placeholder | Replace With |
|---|---|
| `your-email@example.com` | Your actual email address |
| `Ongole, Andhra Pradesh, India` | Your current city/location |
| Profile image URL (Cloudinary) | Your own hosted image URL |
| Resume download URL (Cloudinary) | Your own hosted resume URL |

### Add a New Project

Copy one of the existing `.card.pcrd` blocks inside `#projects` and update:
- `src` on the `<img>` or `<video>` tag
- `h3` title and `p` description
- `.tag` spans for tech stack
- `href` on the button links

### Change the Colour Accent

In the `:root` block at the top of the `<style>` tag, update:

```css
--accent: #c084fc;   /* change to your preferred colour */
--accent2: #67e8f9;  /* change secondary accent */
```

The gradient `--grad` will automatically update wherever it's used.

### Add More Typing Roles

Find the `roles` array in the `<script>` tag:

```js
const roles = ['Web Developer', 'Frontend Engineer', 'Python Developer', 'UI/UX Enthusiast'];
```

Add or remove strings as needed.

