## 📦 External Dependencies (CDN only)

| Resource | Purpose |
|---|---|
| [Google Fonts — Syne](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Syne) | Display typeface |
| [Google Fonts — Space Grotesk](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Space+Grotesk) | Body typeface |
| [Google Fonts — JetBrains Mono](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/JetBrains+Mono) | Monospace labels |
| [Font Awesome 6.4](https://fontawesome.com) | Icons |
| [Cloudinary](https://cloudinary.com) | Hosted images and videos |

No npm, no bundler, no framework — everything runs in the browser as-is.

---

## 📱 Responsive Breakpoints

| Breakpoint | Layout Changes |
|---|---|
| `≥ 1024px` | Two-column hero, about, resume, contact grids |
| `< 1024px` | Single-column layout, avatar moves above text |
| `< 768px` | Hamburger nav, sections reduce padding, cursor hidden |
| `< 480px` | Hero buttons stack vertically, project grid single column |

---

## 🌐 Live Sections

| Section ID | Content |
|---|---|
| `#hero` | Name, role, avatar, social links, stats |
| `#about` | Bio, career objective, stat cards |
| `#skills` | Animated progress bars: HTML, CSS, JS, Python, Git |
| `#resume` | Preview image, education & experience timeline, download link |
| `#projects` | Weather API Fetcher, College Portfolio, Land Price Prediction |
| `#intro` | Self-introduction video |
| `#certifications` | Python Full Stack, EduSkills, AICTE internship cards |
| `#contact` | Contact form, info panel, embedded map |

